# BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to the root
# .dockerignore, so this file is the root one plus one extra rule.
#
# The extra rule: the root .dockerignore has to let mock-payment-schema's boot
# jar through, because mock-payment-schema/Dockerfile copies it. This image does
# COPY . and has no use for it, so without this the runner would carry ~100 MB
# of someone else's jar.
mock-payment-schema/build

.git
.github
.gitignore
.gradle
**/.gradle
build
**/build
**/bin
**/out
.idea
**/*.iml
.vscode
.settings
**/.settings
**/.classpath
**/.project
